# Without this file, `docker build`/`podman build` streams the whole repo
# (2GB+, dominated by .git history and the tutorial/example datasets below)
# to the build daemon as the context for every build, which is slow and can
# crash a resource-constrained podman machine VM partway through `COPY . /app`.
# None of this is needed inside the training container -- code only ever
# reads from src/SpaceTravLR_data and the outdir/GCS-mounted data at runtime.
.git
data/
docs/
assets/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
output/
.DS_Store
